<title>USA: SOCCER-SATURDAY'S MLS PLAYOFF RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SATURDAY'S MLS PLAYOFF RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of Major League Soccer</p>
<p>playoff game on Saturday (home team in CAPS):</p>
<p>	 Eastern Conference Finals</p>
<p> Washington DC	2    TAMPA BAY	1</p>
<p>(Washington DC wins best-of-three series 2-0)</p>
<p>Note: DC United advances to MLC Cup championship match</p>
<p>against winner of Western Conference finals between Los</p>
<p>Angeles Galaxy and Kansas City Wiz</p>
</text>
